NO THIRD-PARTY FIRMWARE
-----------------------
This repository contains no Kawai firmware, code, keys or assets. The build reads the user's own,
legally obtained copy of Kawai's system update on the user's machine. Hash values of Kawai's file
appear in the source only so that the tools can verify the user's copy.


